source: tests/cli/snapshots.rs
---
List cohort LTV rows

Usage: vendo measurement ltv list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --granularity <value>  daily | weekly | monthly [default: monthly]
      --segment <key>        Segment key (e.g. "all", "channel:meta") [default: all]
      --from <period>        Inclusive ISO cohort period (YYYY-MM-DD)
      --to <period>          Inclusive ISO cohort period (YYYY-MM-DD)
      --limit <n>            Max rows [default: 50]
      --no-predicted         Skip the naive-decay prediction join
      --json                 Output raw JSON
      --output <field>       Print one field per row
  -h, --help                 Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo measurement ltv list
  $ vendo measurement ltv list --granularity weekly --segment channel:meta
  $ vendo measurement ltv list --from 2025-01-01 --to 2025-06-30 --no-predicted
